   "rdfs:label": "Attribute substitution",
   "skos:altLabel": [
    "Kahneman-Frederick model of heuristic judgment",
    "heuristic attribute substitution",
    "substitution of an easier question"
   ],
   "skos:broader": {
    "@id": "ct:heuristics-and-biases-program"
   },
   "skos:definition": "Kahneman and Frederick's model of heuristic judgment: when a target attribute is hard to assess, people often answer by assessing a related, more accessible heuristic attribute instead, usually without noticing the swap, which produces systematic biases wherever the two attributes diverge.",
