   "rdfs:label": "Leopold von Ranke",
   "skos:altLabel": [
    "Leopold Ranke",
    "Ranke"
   ],
   "skos:definition": "German historian (1795-1886) whose 1824 critique of earlier historians made the questions \"was this writer a firsthand witness, and is this account original or borrowed?\" the starting point of historical method, and whose Berlin seminar trained the first generation of professional, source-critical historians.",
   "skos:inScheme": {
